#: model:muk_website_cookies_consent.cookie,necessity_justification:muk_website_cookies_consent.cookie_odoo_recaptcha
msgid ""
"Only set where the site protects a form you chose to submit, and only to "
"decide whether that submission is automated. Blocking it would stop the form"
" being accepted at all, which is why it is not put to a choice."
msgstr "Solo se establece donde el sitio protege un formulario que usted quiso enviar, y únicamente para decidir si ese envío es automático. Bloquearla impediría que el formulario se aceptara, por eso no se somete a elección."

