msgstr "Revisar todas las preferencias de cookies"

#. module: muk_website_cookies_consent
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:muk_website_cookies_consent.field_muk_website_cookies_consent_consent__ip_hash
msgid ""
"Salted SHA-256 of the truncated visitor IP. Enough to match a record to a "
"claimant who knows their address and roughly when they consented, while "
"storing no readable address."
msgstr "SHA-256 con sal de la IP truncada del visitante. Suficiente para relacionar un registro con quien reclame y conozca su dirección y el momento aproximado de su consentimiento, sin almacenar ninguna dirección legible."

#. module: muk_website_cookies_consent
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:muk_website_cookies_consent.cookies_bar
msgid "Save my choices"
msgstr "Guardar mis preferencias"

#. module: muk_website_cookies_consent
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:muk_website_cookies_consent.action_cookie_service
msgid ""
"Scripts and embeds loaded from a service's hosts are stripped until its "
"purpose is granted."
msgstr "Los scripts y contenidos incrustados cargados desde los servidores de un servicio se eliminan hasta que se concede su finalidad."

#. module: muk_website_cookies_consent
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:muk_website_cookies_consent.field_muk_website_cookies_consent_observation__sample_url
msgid "Seen On"
msgstr "Visto en"

#. module: muk_website_cookies_consent
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:muk_website_cookies_consent.field_muk_website_cookies_consent_category__sequence
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:muk_website_cookies_consent.field_muk_website_cookies_consent_geo_rule__sequence
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:muk_website_cookies_consent.field_muk_website_cookies_consent_service__sequence
